DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
3147::$$$message_0022_0000_0000$$$::"By the way...[lr]::
3148::$$$message_0022_0000_0001$$$::...do you enjoy being with me, Shirou?"::
3149::$$$message_0022_0001_0000$$$::"Huh...?"[lr]::
3150::$$$message_0022_0001_0001$$$::The sudden question makes my hand pause before it can turn the page.::
3151::$$$message_0022_0002_0000$$$::"...Never mind. I just wanted to ask when I saw you reading with such a look of concentration.[lr]::
3152::$$$message_0022_0002_0001$$$::Please, disregard me and continue reading your book."::
3153::$$$message_0022_0003_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
3154::$$$message_0022_0003_0001$$$::I've been reading for thirty minutes in Rider's bedroom.[lr]::
3155::$$$message_0022_0003_0002$$$::While I occasionally intrude to get some reading time in, this might be the first time she's ever spoken to me while I was reading.::
3156::$$$message_0022_0004_0000$$$::"No, I'm only making this face because I'm not used to reading this text, but I'm actually comfortable right now.[lr]::
3157::$$$message_0022_0004_0001$$$::Is it a problem for you if I'm here?"::
3158::$$$message_0022_0005_0000$$$::"I don't mind.[lr]::
3159::$$$message_0022_0005_0001$$$::I've grown used to seeing your squinting at the page when I look up to rest my eyes."[lr]::
3160::$$$message_0022_0005_0002$$$::"Oh. Well, by all means, then..."::
3161::$$$message_0022_0006_0000$$$::I reach for the next book from the pile.[lr]::
3162::$$$message_0022_0006_0001$$$::I tried reading one of the English ones, but I couldn't make heads or tails of it.[lr]::
3163::$$$message_0022_0006_0002$$$::I'll pick a more normal one next... Oh, what's this enterprising romance of the harlequin variety that goes all-out in appealing to feminine tastes?::
3164::$$$message_0022_0007_0000$$$::"...Huh. The synopsis sounds interesting. Rider, do you read stuff like this?"[lr]::
3165::$$$message_0022_0007_0001$$$::My curious gaze asks if she found it interesting.[lr]::
3166::$$$message_0022_0007_0002$$$::"I found it quite interesting.[lr]::
3167::$$$message_0022_0007_0003$$$::However, I don't know if you would agree."::
3168::$$$message_0022_0008_0000$$$::Hmm, pretty blunt.[lr]::
3169::$$$message_0022_0008_0001$$$::...It seems long, so maybe I'll look at it another time. I'll go with this other novel about a swordsman.::
3170::$$$message_0022_0009_0000$$$::"Oh, right. Want some tea, Rider? I can make some if you're thirsty."[lr]::
3171::$$$message_0022_0009_0001$$$::"...No, I'm fine.[lr]::
3172::$$$message_0022_0009_0002$$$::I will partake if you're also having tea, though."::
3173::$$$message_0022_0010_0000$$$::I guess I was just being meddlesome.[lr]::
3174::$$$message_0022_0010_0001$$$::Rider's immersed in her book, so I should do the same. I'll borrow a book and go back to my room.::
3175::$$$message_0022_0011_0000$$$::"Shirou."[lr]::
3176::$$$message_0022_0011_0001$$$::"Hm? Ah, sorry to bother you. I'll go back to my room, so you can just focus on..."[lr]::
3177::$$$message_0022_0011_0002$$$::"I already said that I don't mind you being here.[lr]::
3178::$$$message_0022_0011_0003$$$::...I just have a simple question. What sort of reader are you?"::
3179::$$$message_0022_0012_0000$$$::"...?"[lr]::
3180::$$$message_0022_0012_0001$$$::That is an unusual question.[lr]::
3181::$$$message_0022_0012_0002$$$::Is she not very interested in the book she's reading?::
3182::$$$message_0022_0013_0000$$$::"Let me think. I'll read anything, but I'm not particularly attached to any of it. I only started this reading habit because you rubbed off on me."[lr]::
3183::$$$message_0022_0013_0001$$$::"A disinterested reader, then. I see. How very like you."[lr]::
3184::$$$message_0022_0013_0002$$$::She chuckles.[lr]::
3185::$$$message_0022_0013_0003$$$::...For some reason, I get the feeling that an older woman is sneering at my childishness.::
3186::$$$message_0022_0014_0000$$$::"So what? You're similar, too.[lr]::
3187::$$$message_0022_0014_0001$$$::The books here are all of different genres. They aren't consistent at all. It's more like you aren't particularly interested in any one kind of book, rather than having too many interests."::
3188::$$$message_0022_0015_0000$$$::"One kind of book?[lr]::
3189::$$$message_0022_0015_0001$$$::I see. It's true that I don't have a favorite genre.[lr]::
3190::$$$message_0022_0015_0002$$$::However, my hobby is reading itself."::
3191::$$$message_0022_0016_0000$$$::"Ah."[lr]::
3192::$$$message_0022_0016_0001$$$::Now I get it.[lr]::
3193::$$$message_0022_0016_0002$$$::Rider isn't choosing books based on the genre, like whether they're novels, critiques, or documents. She likes the concept of books and doesn't care what kind they are.[lr]::
3194::$$$message_0022_0016_0003$$$::Although...[lr]::
3195::$$$message_0022_0016_0004$$$::I have a feeling that the closet there contains Rider's secret collection...::
3196::$$$message_0022_0017_0000$$$::"...Hang on, what am I jumping to conclusions for? Looking in there is like asking to get killed..."[lr]::
3197::$$$message_0022_0017_0001$$$::"Hm? [wvl canskip=0 time=400]What is it, Shirou? You looked very afraid for a moment."[lr]::
3198::$$$message_0022_0017_0002$$$::"Nah, nothing. Anyway, I get that your hobby is reading itself.[lr]::
3199::$$$message_0022_0017_0003$$$::But is there anything you find especially interesting? I'm curious to know."::
3200::$$$message_0022_0018_0000$$$::"I suppose I could say...[lr]::
3201::$$$message_0022_0018_0001$$$::There are several I find well-written, if not interesting.[lr]::
3202::$$$message_0022_0018_0002$$$::If you tell me any books that left a deep impression on you, I could recommend you something special."::
3203::$$$message_0022_0019_0000$$$::"Hm...? Books that left a deep impression on me... I'm not sure."[lr]::
3204::$$$message_0022_0019_0001$$$::I can't think of any book that really stayed with me.[lr]::
3205::$$$message_0022_0019_0002$$$::I haven't really spent much time reading until recently, so I'm at a loss.::
3206::$$$message_0022_0020_0000$$$::"...Well, at least I won't have any shortage of reading material while you're around.[lr]::
3207::$$$message_0022_0020_0001$$$::Reading is fine, though, Rider, but don't you have any other hobbies? I know you're good at any kind of sports, so you could find some other form of recreation."::
3208::$$$message_0022_0021_0000$$$::"Recreation? I already find my current lifestyle adequately fulfilling."[lr]::
3209::$$$message_0022_0021_0001$$$::"No, that might be true, but I mean..."[lr]::
3210::$$$message_0022_0021_0002$$$::...Rider never goes to Shinto on her own.[lr]::
3211::$$$message_0022_0021_0003$$$::It feels like she might never go out there for fun unless it's for something as significant as a date.::
3212::$$$message_0022_0022_0000$$$::"Not to worry. I am enjoying my life as I see fit.[lr]::
3213::$$$message_0022_0022_0001$$$::...Ah, I know. If I said that I've been doing things you don't know about...would you believe me?"::
3214::$$$message_0022_0023_0000$$$::"Mmrgh."[lr]::
3215::$$$message_0022_0023_0001$$$::Her bewitching smile makes my heart pound.[lr]::
3216::$$$message_0022_0023_0002$$$::...When she says something like that with that kind of expression, I imagine improper things.::
3217::$$$message_0022_0024_0000$$$::"Hehe. Don't worry. I would never drink the blood of the townspeople. I've simply been spreading my wings in my own way.[lr]::
3218::$$$message_0022_0024_0001$$$::I too am a woman. I'm not as rigid in my ways as you or Sakura are concerned about."::
3219::$$$message_0022_0025_0000$$$::The seductive smile shifts into a sunny one.[lr]::
3220::$$$message_0022_0025_0001$$$::It makes me feel[se storage=se323.wav] relieved.[lr]::
3221::$$$message_0022_0025_0002$$$::"Rider, are you in there?"[lr]::
3222::$$$message_0022_0025_0003$$$::"Sakura? Come in."[lr]::
3223::$$$message_0022_0025_0004$$$::Sakura enters.[lr]::
3224::$$$message_0022_0025_0005$$$::I get up to make room for[se storage=se188.wav] her to sit.::
3225::$$$message_0022_0026_0000$$$::"I wanted to ask you something... [cacheimage storage=桜私服08g(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=桜私服08g(中) textoff=0]Huh? [cacheimage storage=桜私服10b(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg storage=桜私服10b(中) pos=r time=300 textoff=0]You're here too, Senpai?"[lr]::
3226::$$$message_0022_0026_0001$$$::"Yeah. Just doing some reading."[lr]::
3227::$$$message_0022_0026_0002$$$::"Yes. Shirou sometimes spends his time in this way. He thinks of my room as a library."::
3228::$$$message_0022_0027_0000$$$::Rider sounds slightly exasperated.[lr]::
3229::$$$message_0022_0027_0001$$$::But her voice is gentle and not at all upset that I treat her room like a library.[lr]::
3230::$$$message_0022_0027_0002$$$::I'm happy to hear it.::
3231::$$$message_0022_0028_0000$$$::"...Yeah. Don't mind me, Sakura. I'm just reading a book... Oh, I see.[lr]::
3232::$$$message_0022_0028_0001$$$::If you need to talk to Rider, I'll leave."[lr]::
3233::$$$message_0022_0028_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
3234::$$$message_0022_0028_0003$$$::?[lr]::
3235::$$$message_0022_0028_0004$$$::Sakura looks from me to Rider.::
3236::$$$message_0022_0029_0000$$$::"Senpai, do you have a moment?"[lr]::
3237::$$$message_0022_0029_0001$$$::"S-sure. What's up, Sakura? I thought you wanted to talk to Rider."[lr]::
3238::$$$message_0022_0029_0002$$$::"I do, but I just remembered something urgent. Come with me, please."[lr]::
3239::$$$message_0022_0029_0003$$$::"...? Okay, I can do that.[lr]::
3240::$$$message_0022_0029_0004$$$::Rider, can I leave the book like this? I'll come back and pick up where I left off."::
3241::$$$message_0022_0030_0000$$$::"Yes. I'll leave it where it is.[lr]::
3242::$$$message_0022_0030_0001$$$::But Sakura, what did you want to speak to me about?"[lr]::
3243::$$$message_0022_0030_0002$$$::"Um... [cacheimage storage=桜私服03e(中)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg storage=桜私服03e(中) pos=r time=300 textoff=0]It's nothing. I'll ask you later."::
3244::$$$message_0022_0031_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
3245::$$$message_0022_0031_0001$$$::...W-what's with this tension?[lr]::
3246::$$$message_0022_0031_0002$$$::Rider thinks soberly for a moment.::
3247::$$$message_0022_0032_0000$$$::"...I'm terribly sorry, Sakura."[lr]::
3248::$$$message_0022_0032_0001$$$::"Huh?"::
3249::$$$message_0022_0033_0000$$$::"U-um... Rider, why are you apologizing?"[lr]::
3250::$$$message_0022_0033_0001$$$::"Because I've wronged you.[lr]::
3251::$$$message_0022_0033_0002$$$::If you want me to, I can spell out what I regret doing."::
3252::$$$message_0022_0034_0000$$$::"N-[wvl][shock vmax=15 time=300 count=-3]no, it's okay! Just leave it at that, Rider!"[lr]::
3253::$$$message_0022_0034_0001$$$::"Very well.[lr]::
3254::$$$message_0022_0034_0002$$$::Again, I deeply apologize, Sakura."::
3255::$$$message_0022_0035_0000$$$::Sakura looks like she wants to curl into fetal position.[lr]::
3256::$$$message_0022_0035_0001$$$::...I don't know what Rider's apologizing for, but it must be something pretty bad.::
3257::$$$message_0022_0036_0000$$$::"...So what did you need, Sakura?"[lr]::
3258::$$$message_0022_0036_0001$$$::"Uh, [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-4]right! U-um![lr]::
3259::$$$message_0022_0036_0002$$$::Just come with me, Senpai!"[lr]::
3260::$$$message_0022_0036_0003$$$::Sakura pulls at me.[lr]::
3261::$$$message_0022_0036_0004$$$::Then, Rider adds, almost unconsciously,::
3262::$$$message_0022_0037_0000$$$::"Shirou. I know this is sudden, but I've changed my mind.[lr]::
3263::$$$message_0022_0037_0001$$$::I'll lend you the book, so go ahead and take your time with it. I've decided that I want to read alone."[lr]::
3264::$$$message_0022_0037_0002$$$::"Huh? But you just said..."[lr]::
3265::$$$message_0022_0037_0003$$$::"Oh, Senpai! Hurry up and come with me, please!"::
3266::$$$message_0022_0038_0000$$$::"Is this about dinner? Do you want me to grill the fish after all? Or do we not have enough in the fridge? Did you want fresh rice?"[lr]::
3267::$$$message_0022_0038_0001$$$::"..."::
3268::$$$message_0022_0039_0000$$$::"It's not about dinner? Then, the kyudo club?"[lr]::
3269::$$$message_0022_0039_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
3270::$$$message_0022_0039_0002$$$::Sakura finally stops.[lr]::
3271::$$$message_0022_0039_0003$$$::She tenses, as if about to say something.[lr]::
3272::$$$message_0022_0039_0004$$$::".........[say storage=emi0220_sak_0130 name=桜][chgfg storage=桜私服03d(中) time=300 textoff=0]...?"[lr]::
3273::$$$message_0022_0039_0005$$$::The question mark practically appears over my head.::
3274::$$$message_0022_0040_0000$$$::"Sakura?"[lr]::
3275::$$$message_0022_0040_0001$$$::"Ah... I'm sorry. What was I doing again?"[lr]::
3276::$$$message_0022_0040_0002$$$::...Um, that's what I'm asking.::
3277::$$$message_0022_0041_0000$$$::"...That's a big thing to forget.[lr]::
3278::$$$message_0022_0041_0001$$$::Are you feeling exhausted lately?"[lr]::
3279::$$$message_0022_0041_0002$$$::"N-no, not really..."[lr]::
3280::$$$message_0022_0041_0003$$$::"No, I'm sure you are. You should take the day off. I can handle dinner on my own.[lr]::
3281::$$$message_0022_0041_0004$$$::Well, if that's all, then I'm going back to Rider's room to get[line len=2]"::
3282::$$$message_0022_0042_0000$$$::"N-n-n-no! You can't! [wvl canskip=0 time=200]S-Senpai,[cacheimage storage=桜私服10d(中),i衛宮邸廊下][wvl canskip=0 time=400] that's right, dinner. [wshock canskip=0][wm canskip=0][clfg][fg index=1000 pos=c storage=桜私服10d(中)][dash textoff=0 page=back mx=0 opacity=255 layer=all irot=-0.0 cx=398 imag=1.9 time=300 cy=43 mag=1 my=410 rot=-0.0 accel=2][fadein textoff=0 time=300 storage=i衛宮邸廊下 noclear=1][se storage=se317.wav][wvl]Okay.[shock vmax=20 time=600 count=4] Let's go make it right now!"[lr]::
3283::$$$message_0022_0042_0001$$$::...[wait canskip=0 time=300]She's suddenly very spirited.[lr]::
3284::$$$message_0022_0042_0002$$$::I must have misread her as being tired.::
3285::$$$message_0022_0043_0000$$$::"Okay. Isn't it too early, though?"[lr]::
3286::$$$message_0022_0043_0001$$$::"That's okay! [cacheimage storage=桜私服03e(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服03e(中)]We have four, even five mouths to feed these days, and people get hungrier in the fall!"[lr]::
3287::$$$message_0022_0043_0002$$$::"Nah, I mean...maybe you and Saber do. And Fuji-nee too."::
3288::$$$message_0022_0044_0000$$$::"Yes! Isn't it nice to work hard at cooking during this season when the rice tastes good!? Ahahaha!"[lr]::
3289::$$$message_0022_0044_0001$$$::Sakura laughs unnaturally.[lr]::
3290::$$$message_0022_0044_0002$$$::...She's being very forceful, like she needs to keep me in the kitchen.::
3291::$$$message_0022_0045_0000$$$::"...All right. Dinner is important to you today, huh?[lr]::
3292::$$$message_0022_0045_0001$$$::Then I'll put some spirit into it. I should go ask Rider what she wants to eat."[lr]::
3293::$$$message_0022_0045_0002$$$::"N-n-no! I said no! [cacheimage storage=桜私服08k(中),i衛宮邸廊下][wvl][wshock canskip=0][wm canskip=0][clfg][fg index=1000 pos=c storage=桜私服08k(中)][dash textoff=0 page=back mx=0 opacity=255 layer=all irot=-0.0 cx=398 imag=1.9 time=300 cy=43 mag=1 my=410 rot=-0.0 accel=2][fadein textoff=0 time=300 storage=i衛宮邸廊下 noclear=1][shock vmax=20 time=600 count=4][se storage=se317.wav]Rider doesn't care about food, so you're only going to bother her!"::
3294::$$$message_0022_0046_0000$$$::This smells.[lr]::
3295::$$$message_0022_0046_0001$$$::Sakura's behaving way too suspiciously.[lr]::
3296::$$$message_0022_0046_0002$$$::That said, [lr]::
3297::$$$message_0022_0046_0003$$$::well, how do I put this...::
3298::$$$message_0022_0047_0000$$$::"See, look at this! [movefg opacity=0 time=400 pos=l accel=2 storage=桜私服03e(近) textoff=0][cacheimage storage=桜私服07e(近)][wvl canskip=false time=150][movefg opacity=255 time=300 pos=l accel=-2 storage=桜私服07e(近) textoff=0]I actually brought you an apron! Look, it has a crab and egg pattern! I thought it would look good on you, so I wanted to surprise you!"::
3299::$$$message_0022_0048_0000$$$::[move time=120 path=(-24,51,255)(-32,63,255) storage=桜私服07e(近) accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0]"And look, [wait canskip=false time=250][move time=80 path=(-21,53,255)(4,50,255)(21,52,255)(33,63,255) storage=桜私服07e(近) accel=2 spline=1 textoff=0]it does look [wait canskip=false time=220][move time=80 path=(21,52,255)(4,50,255)(-21,53,255)(-32,63,255) storage=桜私服07e(近) accel=2 spline=1 textoff=0]great on you!" [wait canskip=false time=200][movefg opacity=255 time=300 pos=l accel=3 storage=桜私服07e(近) textoff=0]Sakura fusses over me.[lr]::
3300::$$$message_0022_0048_0001$$$::I'm not sure why she's doing this, but[lr]::
3301::$$$message_0022_0048_0002$$$::somehow, [wm canskip=0][chgfg time=200 storage=桜私服10b(近) textoff=0 last=桜私服07e(近)]watching her gives me energy.::
3302::$$$message_0022_0049_0000$$$::"Okay. I don't know what's going on, but I can tell how driven you are.[lr]::
3303::$$$message_0022_0049_0001$$$::I'll do everything I can to help you, so let's make a dinner that'll blow everyone's socks off."[lr]::
3304::$$$message_0022_0049_0002$$$::"Y-yay! Thank you so much, Senpai! [wvl][move textoff=0 time=120 path=(190,74,255)(190,48,255)(190,68,255)(190,41,255)(190,68,255)(190,41,255) storage=桜私服07e(近) accel=0]Let's try your apron on right now!"::
3305::$$$message_0022_0050_0000$$$::Sakura puts the apron on me, looking genuinely happy.[lr]::
3306::$$$message_0022_0050_0001$$$::Now...[lr]::
3307::$$$message_0022_0050_0002$$$::My plans have changed, but Sakura's smile gives me energy.[lr]::
3308::$$$message_0022_0050_0003$$$::I'll put everything I've got into making a feast tonight.::
903265::$$$message_9022_0037_0003$$$::"Oh, Senpai! Hurry up and come with me, please!"[r]::

